'''Box Witch and Minions''' (ハコの魔女とその手下, ''Hako no Majo to sono Teshita'', '''Box Witch and Its Minions''') is a [[:Category:Witch Enemies|Witch]] enemy that appears in the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]. They were added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Box Witch and Minions
|image = E 276.png
|appearance = [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 2,000¢ - 7,900¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy unit consists of a flying computer monitor accompanied by two wooden angel-like creatures. Although she is above the ground, she does not count as a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy. Instead, she has only the Witch trait. In this case, she will stand no chance against [[:Category:Witch Killer Cats|Witch Killers]] such as [[Li'l Madoka (Rare Cat)|Li'l Madoka]], [[Li'l Homura (Special Cat)|Li'l Homura]] or any [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]] from [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event|the collaboration event]].

==Strategy==
Despite her enormous DPS, the Box Witch has mediocre range and a longer-than-average backswing, making her easy to stall with enough meatshields. As such, she should be a pushover as long as you use Witch Killers or other long range-attacking cats leveled up enough and protect them with smaller cats like the [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Basic Cat]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]].

