==Trivia==
*Box Witch and Minions' monitor has five different screens they use in their animations, however in practice only four of those will ever be seen. This is because two screens are only used in their idle animation. While Box Witch and Minons have no time between attacks, the idle animation will display for 1 frame after an attack, which leaves only one screen completely unused.
*Prior to [[Version 14.1 Update|Version 14.1]], Box Witch and Minions' name was Kirsten.
*Box Witch and Minions, [[Serum (Enemy)|Serum]], [[Celesse (Enemy)|Celesse]], [[Fuu (Enemy)|Fuu]], [[Michelia (Enemy)|Michelia]] are the only non-[[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemies to have halos.

